  "contract": [
    "Null frame returns-1. Pack56-byte raw input,24-byte unique input and24-byte result with cleared padding and typed local arrays. Capacitor mode must equal1 to copy four cap words, set four enable words and cap_channel_num4. Other byte values leave those buffers/count zero.",
    "Reuse the live initialization selector, cap flag and timeout counter. Cache selector as input colour, preserve zero previous status and12 zero IPD words. Pack PPG/gain/driver positions0/4/8 from three raw/AGC words; enable bytes intentionally remain0. Sign-extend accelerometer values and keep raw sleep byte,24 bits and chip1.",
    "After calculation, always compute wrapped32 seconds*uint16 sample rate, even on errors. If counter reaches/exceeds threshold and state low2 bits are0, OR1 and reset counter. Increment with32-bit wrap only if bit1 is clear and live frame ID equals8000. A forced IR transition resets then increments to1 in the same call.",
    "Only then return-5 on nonzero full32 core status. Success publishes only for live cap flag not1 and result flag exactly1: update1,mask3,popcount2,state/confidence. Reload live result pointers and selector after callbacks; only selector0/1 calls a reporter and reads the low counter byte.",
    "Both reporter bodies share one report-state byte and ignore the update byte/frame ID. Exact state word1 triggers on only when previous is not1; otherwise any bit1 triggers off when previous is not2. Clear event2/set8 for on, clear8/set2 for off, then store report-state1/2 after both calls.",
    "Actual native/C clear,sleep,popcount and event helpers execute. Direct fixtures normalize only defined raw/unique pointer fields, verify disjoint extents and use independent input/timeout oracles. Dispatcher replays execute ADT/HR/HRV/soft-ADT adapters, including green/IR frames with initialized function IDs."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "NADT calculation remains modeled and unfinished; hardware sampling, physical interrupts/concurrency, arbitrary private-frame aliases and final executable startup/linking remain unverified. Other computation cores, HR diagnostics and the SpO2 executor are also unfinished.",
    "The7270 pairs comprise3884 direct and3386 dispatcher cases; some integrated cases gate or fault before soft ADT. Direct cases include87 selected matching faults and both fixtures cover all578 new native bytes. Core/logger/remaining SpO2 effects and selected helper mutations are modeled.",
    "Five newly owned bytes correspond to native existing RAM: shared report state20007c14 starts0 and timeout seconds20007c48 starts30. Stock RW handler replay on two poison patterns matches an independent decoder and object initializers, with whole-region guards. This does not prove the final source startup/placement.",
    "All898 units compile and compose without failures/duplicate strong symbols;887 prior nongenerated source/object pairs and source-plan/cache files are unchanged. One aggregate adapter import is replaced by explicit goodix_nadt_calc, leaving78 application/22 boot imports. No firmware core stub or paid compiler is introduced."
  ],
